License scope notice
====================

The six ROS 2 packages under ros2_ws/src declare Apache-2.0 in their
existing package.xml and setup.py metadata. This publication preserves
those declarations. The Apache License, Version 2.0 text is available at:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No repository-wide license has yet been selected for the remaining
integration, camera-service, documentation, and deployment files. This
notice does not grant an additional license to those files. The project
author must confirm the intended scope before a repository-wide license
is added.

Grounded-SAM-2, GroundingDINO, SAM 2, GraspNet, the robot drivers, and
their model weights are external dependencies with their own terms.
Their licenses are not replaced by this notice or by ROS package
metadata. See third_party/README.md for upstream references.
